  "items": [
    {
      "name": "1 in 3 adults has it — and no symptoms warn you",
      "char_file": "탄산음료_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "About 31% of US adults",
        "have a triglyceride level",
        "of 150 or higher",
        "",
        "High triglycerides rarely",
        "cause symptoms — most people",
        "only find out from bloodwork"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Refined carbs",
      "char_file": "탄산음료_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "First, refined carbs —",
        "soda, white bread,",
        "white rice",
        "",
        "Extra glucose gets converted",
        "into fatty acids and",
        "packaged as triglycerides"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Swap for unsweetened drinks and whole grains",
      "char_file": "귀리_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Swap soda for water",
        "or unsweetened tea",
        "",
        "Trade white rice or bread",
        "for whole grains",
        "like oats"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Alcohol",
      "char_file": "맥주_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Second is alcohol",
        "",
        "Breaking down alcohol ramps",
        "up fatty acid production —",
        "much of it ends up",
        "circulating as triglycerides"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Drink less, and never on an empty stomach",
      "char_file": "물컵_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Cut back on how often",
        "and how much you drink",
        "",
        "Skip the empty-stomach habit",
        "and build in a few",
        "alcohol-free days a week"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Inactivity",
      "char_file": "의자_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Third is inactivity",
        "",
        "The longer you sit, the less",
        "active the enzyme that clears",
        "triglycerides from your blood"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "30 minutes of brisk walking",
      "char_file": "운동화_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Aim for about 30 minutes",
        "of brisk walking most days",
        "",
        "Moving your muscles",
        "reactivates the enzyme",
        "that clears triglycerides"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "closing": {
    "headline": [
      [
        "Cut refined carbs, drink less,",
        "and move more —"
